Section: 2 METHODOLOGY
Text: After that, an MLP with softmax is applied to predict whether the query and the bag is asking the same question. Finally, the loss function minimizes the cross entropy of the training data. Due to the out-of-order of the bag, we do not model the bag representation by CNN or LSTM, and experiments show the pooling-based method works well.

